                    coach_header:           `Facilitator (the Dean & a finance reviewer)`,
                    coach_intro:            `You designed a strong AI-for-managers program — but for whom? Mid-managers will pay $2,000 and need it self-paced; corporate buyers will pay $4,000 but demand customization. Those are different products. Segment choice is the upstream decision that constrains format, price and content. Pick your learner, fit the format to them, price to their willingness-to-pay, and prove 60 paid seats across two cohorts without breaching the $180,000 cap.`,

